WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.401
The field map is where GroundLog tracks real work on real ground.

00:00:04.401 --> 00:00:08.260
Your site, on satellite, with every layer you have drawn.

00:00:08.960 --> 00:00:12.124
Every tracker category starts from a template.

00:00:12.124 --> 00:00:16.388
Seeding, ground disturbance, linear practices like silt fence.

00:00:16.388 --> 00:00:19.690
Pick the closest one. Everything stays editable.

00:00:20.392 --> 00:00:26.551
A category is built from states. Each state has its own color and its own progress.

00:00:26.551 --> 00:00:31.672
Ground disturbance runs active, inactive, temporary, final, closeout.

00:00:32.376 --> 00:00:38.306
Tap any layer and you get its acreage, its date, its state, and what went down on it.

00:00:39.738 --> 00:00:45.989
Now open the tracker log. Every state measured against the plan, acre by acre, automatically.

00:00:45.989 --> 00:00:48.544
And the number the permit cares about.

00:00:48.544 --> 00:00:51.770
Total open right now, against the five acre cap.

00:00:51.770 --> 00:00:53.518
Nobody adds it up by hand.
